---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404 - Not Found"
  description="The page you were looking for does not exist."
  >
  <section class="max-w-[750px] mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-4xl leading-tight mb-10">Not Found</h1>
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#8e5fa4]">404</p>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-[36rem] text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
      The page you requested could not be found. It may have moved, or the URL might be incorrect.
    </p>

    <section class="mt-10 border-t border-gray-100 pt-8" aria-labelledby="agent-recovery-heading">
      <h2 id="agent-recovery-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Where to look next</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Humans and agents can recover with these machine-readable and editorial indexes:</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-600">
        <li><a class="font-medium text-[#8e5fa4] hover:text-gray-900" href="/llms.txt">Agent guide (llms.txt)</a></li>
        <li><a class="font-medium text-[#8e5fa4] hover:text-gray-900" href="/sitemap-index.xml">XML sitemap</a></li>
        <li><a class="font-medium text-[#8e5fa4] hover:text-gray-900" href="/posts">Writing archive</a></li>
        <li><a class="font-medium text-[#8e5fa4] hover:text-gray-900" href="/about">About and contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
